      "start_seconds": 225.47,
      "end_seconds": 237.5,
      "duration_seconds": 12.03,
      "text": "okay: SpO2 97 percent on room air, BP is 116 over 74. And height 179 centimetres, temperature is 36.9 degrees, respiratory rate 14, weight 78 kilos, pulse 65."
